			"notes": "Added Alloy Forge! Added a new way to make tools via the Alloy Forge! You need to make a mold of a specific tool by putting in the ignots that you want the tool to be made of then instead of sticks fill in every space with sand then throw that mold into the Alloy Forge and you should get the tool head/blade then attach it with sticks to get the final product! Also added better support for SPR, added support for Mod Menu and fixed emissives when using shaders! Also a few QoL and bug fixes."
		},
